      <p>You tell me what brings you here, your history, your habits and what you expect from the sessions.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>I carry out an assessment</h3>
      <p>Posture, breathing, mobility. A pelvic floor examination is never compulsory: it is only carried out with your consent.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>We set a direction</h3>
      <p>I explain what I have observed, and together we choose realistic goals and a frequency of sessions.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>You leave with tools</h3>
      <p>Simple exercises to repeat at home, so that progress continues between sessions.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

